{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18302","headline":"赠徐州族侄 · 韩愈","name":"赠徐州族侄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我年十八九，壮气起胸中。\n作书献云阙，辞家逐秋蓬。\n岁时易迁次，身命多厄穷。\n一名虽云就，片禄不足充。\n今者复何事，卑栖寄徐戎。\n萧条资用尽，濩落门巷空。\n朝眠未能起，远怀方郁悰。\n击门者谁子，问言乃吾宗。\n自云有奇术，探妙知天工。\n既往怅何及，将来喜还通。\n期我语非佞，当爲佐时雍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}